From c64a510f50290baa94b518f8e75adc6f46d7053d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Perrin <44126061+AlexPerrin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:47:16 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Grand Exchange: trade history

The clerks' History op and the GE interface's History button open ge_history (383),
filled with ge_history_init / ge_history_addline / ge_history_finish (1644-1646):
the last 40 finished offers (and aborted ones with something traded), newest first,
with the sale tax. A line's Buy-offer starts a buy offer for its item in the first free
slot; the Exchange button goes back. History lives in 160 perm varps.
---
